<TD WIDTH="4%">&nbsp;</TD>
<TD WIDTH="4%" VALIGN="top" ALIGN="left">5.</TD>
<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top">This Agreement is executed on behalf of the Fund by the Fund&#146;s officers as officers and not individually and the obligations imposed upon the Fund by this Subscription Agreement are not binding upon any of the
Fund&#146;s Trustees, officers or shareholders individually but are binding only upon the assets and property of the Fund. </TD></TR></TABLE>
